data: {"id":"p1","object":"chat.completion.chunk","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"content":"I read it and split it five ways, smallest first.\n\n```\n{\"foundry_plan\":1,\"venture_id\":\"arca\",\"repo\":\"arca\",\"source_title\":\"Auction aggregator PRD\",\"created_at\":\"2026-08-28T09:00:00.000Z\",\"tickets\":[{\"slug\":\"auction-source-research\",\"title\":\"Find which auction houses publish a feed\",\"source\":\"PRD §1, Sources\",\"depends_on\":[],\"body\":\"# Find which auction houses publish a feed\\n\\n**Status:** Todo · **Area:** Research · **Depends on:** —\\n\\nWhich houses expose listings, under what terms, and at what refresh rate.\\n\\n## Acceptance criteria\\n\\n- [ ] Every candidate house is listed with its terms of service.\\n\"},{\"slug\":\"auction-feed-ingestion\",\"title\":\"Ingest the feeds we are allowed to use\",\"source\":\"PRD §2, Ingestion\",\"depends_on\":[\"auction-source-research\"],\"body\":\"# Ingest the feeds we are allowed to use\\n\\n**Status:** Todo · **Area:** ETL · **Depends on:** —\\n\\nPull each permitted feed on a schedule and normalise it.\\n\\n## Acceptance criteria\\n\\n- [ ] A listing appears within five minutes of going live.\\n\"},{\"slug\":\"auction-live-view\",\"title\":\"One page showing every live auction\",\"source\":\"PRD §3, The view\",\"depends_on\":[\"auction-feed-ingestion\"],\"body\":\"# One page showing every live auction\\n\\n**Status:** Todo · **Area:** Web · **Depends on:** —\\n\\nOne page, every live listing across every source, filterable by set and grade.\\n\\n## Acceptance criteria\\n\\n- [ ] The page reads on a phone.\\n\"},{\"slug\":\"auction-watch-notifications\",\"title\":\"Notify when a watched card is listed\",\"source\":\"PRD §4, Notifications\",\"depends_on\":[\"auction-feed-ingestion\"],\"body\":\"# Notify when a watched card is listed\\n\\n**Status:** Todo · **Area:** Web · **Depends on:** —\\n\\nA collector watches a card and hears about it the moment it is listed.\\n\\n## Acceptance criteria\\n\\n- [ ] A watch fires once per listing, never twice.\\n\"},{\"slug\":\"auction-aggregator-qa\",\"title\":\"QA the aggregator end to end\",\"source\":\"PRD §5, Acceptance\",\"depends_on\":[\"auction-live-view\",\"auction-watch-notifications\"],\"body\":\"# QA the aggregator end to end\\n\\n**Status:** Todo · **Area:** QA · **Depends on:** —\\n\\nDrive the whole thing against live feeds before it goes near a collector.\\n\\n## Acceptance criteria\\n\\n- [ ] Every criterion above is checked on a real listing.\\n\"}]}\n```\n\nStrike anything you do not want, then file the set."},"finish_reason":null}]}

